#. module: theme_pawtastic
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_theme_pawtastic
msgid ""
"A search-led header above a playful hero with scribble and shape doodles "
"leads into a colorful bento photo grid, a featured picture block, and a "
"numbered process steps row, then a rounded-card image showcase and "
"testimonials wall before a trust-badges strip and collapsible FAQ, with "
"rounded-corner cards and hand-drawn doodle accents as the recurring visual "
"signature. Image-forward and playful, e-commerce-driven / suited for pet "
"supply stores, pet grooming services, veterinary clinics, and pet care brands"
msgstr ""
"搜索优先的导航栏位于趣味手绘涂鸦首屏上方，衔接色彩丰富的便当式图片网格、特色"
"图片区块、带编号流程步骤行，接着是圆角卡片图片展示区与好评墙，最后是信任标识"
"栏和可折叠常见问题区；圆角卡片与手绘涂鸦装饰是贯穿全站的视觉标识。视觉优先、"
"风格活泼，以电商销售为核心 / 适用于宠物用品店、宠物美容服务、兽医诊所以及宠物"
"护理品牌"

#. module: theme_pawtastic
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_theme_pawtastic
